# What never needs to reach a deployment.
#
# Without this the CLI was uploading 1.1 GB and timing out: `evidence/` alone is
# 1.4 GB of QA captures, and none of it is code. Everything here is either
# rebuilt on the host, local working material, or history.
#
# `runs-seed/` is deliberately absent — it is read at runtime and has to ship.

# The key comes from the project's Environment Variables and nowhere else. The
# CLI does not read .gitignore, so without these lines the local .env is uploaded
# with the source and the build says so: "Detected .env file".
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

node_modules
.next
.git
.runs
evidence
_workshop
.claude

# Local working notes and the brief, not part of the app.
goal.md
gonka-ai.md
PROMT.md
Hackathon_Challenge_AI-for-Society.md
CLAUDE.md
